    "RSS is process high-water memory including fixture; index payload is encoded JSON, not allocator memory.",
    "The conservative budget sums measured maxima and configured delays in this fixed load; it is not an unlimited-load guarantee.",
    "A passing Go benchmark execution only confirms measurement completion; contract checks above determine performance status."
  ]
}
